    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/580e8c3753aa2be272ee260bb40261b8.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=50 /></span> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story.</strong></h2>In <i>Little Mage</i>, you play as an \u00c6ther Mage, the first to awaken in a world ravaged by the Fall. The city of Hornedrose, once a thriving capital, now lies in ruin, a tomb for the Sixteen, ancient mages imprisoned for their role in a catastrophic event. As the last hope, you must traverse the city's crumbling districts, face powerful enemies, and unravel the secrets that could either save or destroy what's left of the world.   <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/ab79372caad5fd6bc3423809df27bbe3.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=803 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World.</strong></h2>A dark, lived-in world showcasing the decaying architectural grandeur of the fallen Magie. The city\u2019s intricate blend of ancient and otherworldly designs sets the stage for your journey, filled with rich discoveries, unique languages, and a deep history waiting to be uncovered. Explore every corner, overcoming platforming challenges that test your skill as you navigate treacherous heights and crumbling depths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/fbbc6ec072e4cb1d503dd06640d6a956.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/7559e01317087e3627d473ee14aff00a.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/796aa4ca5e1a27da075f48b7227062e8.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/4209bec45a861cab518431f9c746f5d8.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/25c9305bbf63f48453122e7f83fe5b6b.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features.</strong></h2> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Environments:</strong> Meticulously designed spaces blending classical and modern artistry, creating a living, rich world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative and Lore:</strong> Explore Hornedrose\u2019s fate through environmental storytelling, ancient texts, and memorable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Responsive Platforming Challenges:</strong> Navigate the world with precise controls, rewarding skillful movement and platforming mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells and Elemental Magic:</strong> Use and upgrade Fire, Earth, Metal, \u00c6ther, and other incantations for combat and traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses:</strong> Face epic, strategic boss battles in stunning set pieces that test precision and skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Customization:</strong> Level up, unlock powerful gear, and tailor your playstyle as you explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DARC Mini-game:</strong> A strategic, fully integrated card mini-game with thousands of drops for added fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immense Replayability:</strong> Uncover secrets, collect equipment, and explore new pathways with each playthrough.<br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/fbbc6ec072e4cb1d503dd06640d6a956.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/47e2885fe7856ad81515086ef9c54b42.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/cf773db1139c39efc1934ecf4d547260.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/db908c1d3c00acf1a9c5ffe302024209.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Violoken.</strong></h2>Violoken is an architect and art director turned solo developer, leveraging their background to enhance game design. Alongside development, they are completing a PhD on the intersection of architecture and games. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/5ad2a11014e5494dabe5840acabe58b6.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=347 /></span>Join us on Discord and socials to support the game, share your thoughts, and discover which Mage Sect calls to you. Links \u27a4<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/580e8c3753aa2be272ee260bb40261b8.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
