 Uncover secrets, collect equipment, and explore new pathways with each playthrough.<br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/fbbc6ec072e4cb1d503dd06640d6a956.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=54 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/47e2885fe7856ad81515086ef9c54b42.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/cf773db1139c39efc1934ecf4d547260.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/db908c1d3c00acf1a9c5ffe302024209.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Violoken.</strong></h2>Violoken is an architect and art director turned solo developer, leveraging their background to enhance game design. Alongside development, they are completing a PhD on the intersection of architecture and games. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/5ad2a11014e5494dabe5840acabe58b6.avif?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=347 /></span>Join us on Discord and socials to support the game, share your thoughts, and discover which Mage Sect calls to you. Links \u27a4<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699390/extras/580e8c3753aa2be272ee260bb40261b8.webp?t=1749071584\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Little Mage is an action-packed 2D Metroidvania where you play as an \u00c6ther Mage in a beautifully hand-drawn, high fantasy world. Explore the shattered city of Hornedrose, unleash elemental magic, battle fearsome bosses, and uncover the secrets of a world on the brink of destruction.",
